{"about_the_game":"Deal of the Dead: Final Cut is a Solitaire-style, survival horror, card game.<br><br>Fight your way through a zombie-infested city in search of rescue. Wield a variety of single-use melee weapons and reloadable ranged weapons to take down the undead. Increase your chances of survival by rescuing other survivors and searching for first aid kits and other usable items along the way. Each deck is randomized and reshuffled as you progress through different locations to ensure a unique play though every time.<br><br>Salvation awaits...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMPAIGN</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754660/extras/10271214b3e1de89ef5957e0df9eb9d6.poster.avif?t=1754104946\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754660/extras/10271214b3e1de89ef5957e0df9eb9d6.webm?t=1754104946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754660/extras/10271214b3e1de89ef5957e0df9eb9d6.mp4?t=1754104946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A short tutorial and campaign introduce the gameplay features with a simple narrative and progressive difficulty level. Additional gameplay modes and challenges are unlocked upon the completion of the campaign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEPLAY</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754660/extras/9f18ab6dacb0641ac9d3c2daec72b08f.poster.avif?t=1754104946\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754660/extras/9f18ab6dacb0641ac9d3c2daec72b08f.webm?t=1754104946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Completing the Campaign unlocks Freeplay mode (and additional content). Freeplay mode allows you to fully customize your gameplay experience with settings to input your name and adjust your avatar, difficulty level, number of locations, number of bosses, special weapons, and game background, etc.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accessible turn-based gameplay<br></li><li>Unique hand drawn art style<br></li><li>Short Campaign with 13 stages<br></li><li>Unlockable Challenge mode with additional 13 stages<br></li><li>Unlockable Freeplay mode to fully customize your game<br></li><li>Unlockable art gallery<br></li><li>Fast gameplay loop (under 5 minutes per deck)<br></li><li>More than 200 card variations</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Humanitarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/397578258f1ecf7265c251f7c826c819948cef35.jpg"},{"name":"Man's Best Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/6da4bb51987cd134405fcc82c8a952c55e624d49.jpg"},{"name":"Bring It On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/9cd44d5fb866b86b2094001ce97dd4e718a184e6.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/4ac4f87fd7c462b63fe96e7cb30b6a69c0981927.jpg"},{"name":"Last Stand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/8ab424280bf429faf58d66e4f01b542b05e1ac6d.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/5d9d960ae9d3759cf20d3e90941461348285fe79.jpg"},{"name":"Master Strategist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/15aa9b153e281c4685dc46014fc70e42e5d3f9ac.jpg"},{"name":"New Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754660/e50dcb08a6617268dd9315f8784acdc912ad1531.jpg"},{"name":"Too Ea